        "text": "According to United States Postal Service, the Ninth Circuit held that the Postal Service may be sued for treble damages under federal antitrust laws."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "United States Postal Service",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "1916c2a942259dfa051f76a8fe12dfc99f335530550c6c9a23772c06c78e05fe",
