            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 6,
              "start": 6
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to United States Postal Service, the petitioner argues that this holding was erroneous because the Postal Service is not a \u201cperson\u201d under the antitrust statutes."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Chief Justice Rehnquist",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "1916c2a942259dfa051f76a8fe12dfc99f335530550c6c9a23772c06c78e05fe",
